    howToReach: [{"title": "From Haldwani Haldwani acts as an important gateway to the Kumaon region and a convenient starting point for Himalayan pilgrimage journeys.", "steps": ["1 Reach Haldwani Travel to Haldwani by train, bus, or private cab. The city is well connected to Delhi and other major destinations across North India.", "Reach Haldwani Travel to Haldwani by train, bus, or private cab. The city is well connected to Delhi and other major destinations across North India.", "2 Drive Toward Sonprayag From Haldwani, begin a long scenic mountain drive toward Sonprayag via Rishikesh, Rudraprayag, and Guptkashi. The route offers beautiful views of rivers, valleys, forests, and Himalayan landscapes.", "Drive Toward Sonprayag From Haldwani, begin a long scenic mountain drive toward Sonprayag via Rishikesh, Rudraprayag, and Guptkashi. The route offers beautiful views of rivers, valleys, forests, and Himalayan landscapes.", "3 Arrive and Rest Upon reaching Sonprayag, check into your hotel or guesthouse and relax. Proper rest and acclimatization are recommended before beginning the Kedarnath trek.", "Arrive and Rest Upon reaching Sonprayag, check into your hotel or guesthouse and relax. Proper rest and acclimatization are recommended before beginning the Kedarnath trek."]}, {"title": "From Sonprayag Sonprayag serves as the official transit point and gateway for the Kedarnath pilgrimage route.", "steps": ["1 Travel to Gaurikund From Sonprayag, take a local shuttle toward Gaurikund, which is the official starting point of the Kedarnath trek.", "Travel to Gaurikund From Sonprayag, take a local shuttle toward Gaurikund, which is the official starting point of the Kedarnath trek.", "2 Begin Kedarnath Trek Start the trek toward Kedarnath Temple through scenic mountain trails alongside the Mandakini River. Pony, palki, and helicopter services are also available for pilgrims.", "Begin Kedarnath Trek Start the trek toward Kedarnath Temple through scenic mountain trails alongside the Mandakini River. Pony, palki, and helicopter services are also available for pilgrims.", "3 Continue Toward Chopta Tungnath After completing the Kedarnath visit, travelers usually continue toward Chopta and Tungnath to experience the spiritual and scenic beauty of the Himalayan adventure circuit.", "Continue Toward Chopta Tungnath After completing the Kedarnath visit, travelers usually continue toward Chopta and Tungnath to experience the spiritual and scenic beauty of the Himalayan adventure circuit."]}],
